    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Labyrinth Hotel is an immersive first-person, action-adventure, platformer video game featuring driving and shooting levels. The game offers three endings: two are straightforward, but achieving the true ending requires some backtracking and swimming. The setting is dark and realistic, contrasting with the bright, cartoony characters and cel-shaded enemies, making them stand out and instantly recognizable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The environments also present stark contrasts. You'll navigate tight spaces and cramped hallways that evoke a sense of entrapment, and vast, foggy areas populated by large creatures, which may or may not be passive, playing into the fear of the unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some levels contain guest books that can be collected and read later, providing additional insights into the world and its characters.<br><br><br><br><br>All the enemy and boss models are made by me therefore they are completely copyright free and can be used by anyone who is interested in game development.<br><br>Notice: I've added an Introductory guide/manual on the right below release date, so if some of the more unique mechanics are a bit confusing that should explain them in more detail than the tutorial.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/e14a2645c653d6498cfebe372402744c.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Labyrinth Hotel is an immersive first-person, action-adventure, platformer video game featuring driving and shooting levels. The game offers three endings: two are straightforward, but achieving the true ending requires some backtracking and swimming. The setting is dark and realistic, contrasting with the bright, cartoony characters and cel-shaded enemies, making them stand out and instantly recognizable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/7c2ab717f0523a904920185003d0e5f8.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The environments also present stark contrasts. You'll navigate tight spaces and cramped hallways that evoke a sense of entrapment, and vast, foggy areas populated by large creatures, which may or may not be passive, playing into the fear of the unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.poster.avif?t=1716832679\" width=550 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.webm?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948940/extras/191c4abae7a6c3957041f9173368a908.mp4?t=1716832679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some levels contain guest books that can be collected and read later, providing additional insights into the world and its characters.<br><br><br><br><br>All the enemy and boss models are made by me therefore they are completely copyright free and can be used by anyone who is interested in game development.<br><br>Notice: I've added an Introductory guide/manual on the right below release date, so if some of the more unique mechanics are a bit confusing that should explain them in more detail than the tutorial.",
    "short_description": "Labyrinth Hotel is an immersive, first-person, action-adventure game where the player wakes up locked in a jail cell and must escape, but the only way out is through the Hotel. Contains 20 unique levels, 4 bosses, many unique characters, a cool crt effect, and many secret levels.",
